            "text": ". Round 1: 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Round 4: (2 dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (24 sts). Rounds 5-9: dc around. Round 10: (2 dc, "
