            "text": ") x 6 (18 sts). Round 11: (dc, dc2tog) x 6 (12 sts). Change to light green for the interior section. Rounds 12-14: dc around (12 sts). Stuff. Apply "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
