            "text": "Seed"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In brown yarn, magic ring 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Rounds 4-5: dc around. Round 6: (dc, dc2tog) x 6 (12 sts). Stuff. Round 7: dc2tog x 6. Close."
